direction: right
Rider: Rider app {shape: person}
Driver: Driver app {shape: person}
Gateway: Mobile API {shape: hexagon}
Location: Location service {shape: rectangle}
GeoIndex: Geospatial index {shape: stored_data}
Matching: Matching service {shape: rectangle}
Trips: Trip service {shape: rectangle}
TripDB: Trip database {shape: cylinder}
Events: Trip events {shape: queue}
Notify: Notification service {shape: rectangle}
Rider -> Gateway
Driver -> Gateway: GPS updates
Gateway -> Location
Location -> GeoIndex
Gateway -> Matching: request ride
Matching -> GeoIndex: nearby drivers
Matching -> Trips
Trips -> TripDB
Trips -> Events
Events -> Notify
Notify -> Rider
Notify -> Driver
